he weather sure is nice. This trip out was well worth it.","nextNodeIds":[756600102]},{"nodeId":756600102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":2747071794,"text":"Hmm? Do my eyes deceive me, or do I spy our \"Tum{RUBY#[D]Hope}aini\"?","nextNodeIds":[756600103,756600104]},{"nodeId":756600103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1654090626,"text":"What a coincidence, Xilonen.","nextNodeIds":[756600105]},{"nodeId":756600105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","textMapHash":3179900786,"text":"You tell Xilonen about Irade and the exam stages...","nextNodeIds":[756600106]},{"nodeId":756600106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":1424826138,"text":"Ah, I see... I almost forgot. I did lend her a hand earlier. In fact, our tribe's stage is nearby.","nextNodeIds":[756600107]},{"nodeId":756600107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":4158400730,"text":"At first, she only got the \"Calamity of Tetlahuitl,\" Nkunga, and the \"Sand Dagger of Seit'aad,\" Amuru, to help her out.","nextNodeIds":[756600108]},{"nodeId":756600108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":3250026922,"text":"But those two aren't big on \"mobility,\" preferring head-on clashes, so the resulting feedback was skewed.","nextNodeIds":[756600109]},{"nodeId":756600109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":819004874,"text":"First thing Pacal did after hearing that was to ask me to give some suggestions.","nextNodeIds":[756600110,756600113]},{"nodeId":756600110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":58300746,"text":"So the current stage is your work, then?","nextNodeIds":[756600111]},{"nodeId":756600111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":1240079378,"text":"More or less. Pacal, Irade, and I made a few minor modifications after some discussion.","nextNodeIds":[756600112]},{"nodeId":756600112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":333012850,"text":"Now, the stages are more about getting yourself to advantageous ground quick and managing a shifting fulcrum in the heat of battle.","nextNodeIds":[756600116,756600117]},{"nodeId":756600116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2738828274,"text":"Allow me to accept your trial, then!","nextNodeIds":[756600118]},{"nodeId":756600118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":417870202,"text":"Please, everyone in Natlan has witnessed your strength. I doubt there's a challenge out there that could trip you up.","nextNodeIds":[756600119]},{"nodeId":756600119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":3999960874,"text":"Anyway, the stage is over there. Go try it out if you're interested.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":756600117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3290497858,"text":"Let's hope you didn't make this too difficult...","nextNodeIds":[756600118]},{"nodeId":756600113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4264185274,"text":"You... really make just about everything, don't you...","nextNodeIds":[756600114]},{"nodeId":756600114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":1781516378,"text":"Eh, it's just a few simple devices. They weren't that hard to build.","nextNodeIds":[756600115]},{"nodeId":756600115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","textMapHash":4254293770,"text":"A one-time effort on my part for a continuous pipeline of stronger warriors for our tribe? That's a good deal — especially since I can use that extra free time to work through my commission backlog...","nextNodeIds":[756600116,756600117]},{"nodeId":756600104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2513512898,"text":"I took Irade's commission.","nextNodeIds":[756600105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7566001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7566001],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"Xilonen","count":12},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","count":1}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3056425382,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75660/Q7566001","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO"